{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03165","headline":"郡中每晨兴輙见羣鹤东飞至暮又行列而返哢唳云路甚和乐焉予媿独处江城常目送此意有所羡遂赋以诗 · 张九龄","name":"郡中每晨兴輙见羣鹤东飞至暮又行列而返哢唳云路甚和乐焉予媿独处江城常目送此意有所羡遂赋以诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云间有数鹤，抚翼意无违。\n晓日东田去，烟霄北渚归。\n欢呼良自适，罗列好相依。\n远集长江静，高翔衆鸟稀。\n岂烦仙子驭，何畏野人机。\n却念乘轩者，拘留不得飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03165.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03165","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}